  {
    "id": "2618774651",
    "isSimulated": false,
    "title": "Deltarune Castletown Waltz",
    "description": "By popular request, here is a wallpaper version of my Deltarune animation!\r\nSince the original animation was 600x400, I had to put a bit of work into sizing it up. I hope you enjoy it!\r\n\r\nMusic is \"My castletown\" from Deltarune Chapter 2, by Toby Fox.\r\n__\r\n\r\nNote about this animation; it was initially meant to be viewed as a short video that was the length of the song, and wasn't created with the intent of looping indefinitely. That's why it flickers and resets at the end of the track. Each element of the animation runs with a different number of frames; to make it loop indefinitely, I would have to entirely redo it, which I'm not planning to do for now. Thank you for understanding!",
